OL,3,GNEWSA'We're the eyes in the sky
OL,4,Acracking down on criminals'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn "invaluable" team has been working
OL,7,Facross Somerset for more than three
OL,8,Fdecades helping police catch criminals
OL,9,Fby using 230 meticulously placed CCTV
OL,10,Fcameras.
OL,12,FStaff at the county's control rooms
OL,13,Fmonitor live feeds every second of
OL,14,Fevery day, working closely with police,
OL,15,Fshops and restaurants to alert them to
OL,16,Fwhen a prolific offender is in the
OL,17,Farea.
