OL,3,GNEWSA'We're the eyes in the sky
OL,4,Acracking down on criminals'
OL,5,
OL,6,FManager Jamie Lipton explained that her
OL,7,Fteam are the eyes in the sky that play
OL,8,Fa vital role in cracking down on
OL,9,Fcriminals committing a range of
OL,10,Foffences from violent attacks to
OL,11,Fshoplifting.
OL,13,FPCSO Sam Bushen, from Avon and Somerset
OL,14,FPolice, described the team as
OL,15,F"invaluable" in supporting officers.
